        <initializer>{AnomalyMethod::Z_SCORE}</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Detection algorithm. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Supported values (from <computeroutput>themisdb::analytics::AnomalyMethod</computeroutput>):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>Z_SCORE</computeroutput> (default) – fast, Gaussian assumption</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>MODIFIED_Z_SCORE</computeroutput> – robust, MAD-based</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>IQR</computeroutput> – interquartile range fence</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>ISOLATION_FOREST</computeroutput> – unsupervised tree-based</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>LOF</computeroutput> – density-based Local Outlier Factor</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>ENSEMBLE</computeroutput> – weighted combination of all methods </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
